        manor rig is 18.5 m deep; its steps meet Water Street\u2019s north kerb"},{"what":"the
        river deck","plan":{"box":[-212,-196,228,232.5]},"scene":{"box":[-212,-196,219.47,224.47]},"why":"the
        plan\u2019s box lay on Water Street\u2019s carriageway; the deck stands on
