        +3.0 on the benches","scene":"decks at +3.0 on piles over the bank\u2019s
        upper slope: the plan\u2019s lines run 3 to 6 m channel-side of the benches,
        0.3 to 2.3 m over the ground","why":"the lines stand as ruled; the texture
        puts them over the bank"}]}'
